/E (Developed an Android application using Kotlin with a MongoDB backend, built in Android Studio, designed to manage fine records within university organizations. The application allows users to create organization groups with special access, where the creator becomes the admin. Members can join groups using a unique code generated by the admin, but access requires admin approval. Once approved, members can contribute monthly or weekly dues, while late payments automatically incur fines. Payment is validated through user-uploaded screenshots, which are manually reviewed by the admin.)
