/E (This web-based game, built with jQuery and without a database, stores all data using local storage. It was created as a tutorial for navigating university life, where the objective is to complete 8 semesters by studying. Each in-game time period features a different background. The game includes a money system that can be used for food, with income increasing every second. The game ends either when the player successfully completes all 8 semesters or if any one of the indicators runs out. An optional feature allows the player to add a partner, enhancing the overall gameplay experience.)
